<title>USA: Coastal raises rights trigger, repays debt.</title>
<headline>Coastal raises rights trigger, repays debt.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Physician Group Inc said Tuesday its board had approved raising the trigger on its shareholder rights plan to 20 percent from 15 percent.</p>
<p>The company said also it had completed $40 million in principal repayments on its bank debt, satisfying an obligation that was due January 2.</p>
</text>
